package {{invokerPackage}}.errors

/**
 * Raised when a paged list cannot be followed safely: the server returned the cursor that was just
 * sent, so asking again would loop forever, or a `Link` header pointed to another origin, so
 * following it would send the credentials there. It is not a network error and not an API error:
 * it is a direct child of [{{errorPrefix}}Exception], and the items already delivered are complete and
 * correct. A failed page request raises the SDK error of that failure instead.
 *
 * @param message what made the list impossible to follow; it never holds a query string
 * @property requestPath the path of the request whose response could not be followed, without its
 *   query, or `null` when it is not known
 */
class PaginationException(
    message: String,
    val requestPath: String? = null,
) : {{errorPrefix}}Exception(message)
